{"type":"message","id":"32588553","parentId":"bac71338","timestamp":"2026-03-25T01:05:22.580Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user said \"你好\" (Chinese for \"hello\"). They might prefer Chinese. I should respond naturally and continue the introduction conversation. Let me ask who they are in Chinese since they greeted me in Chinese.","thinkingSignature":"eb7dffe7c5bfc429c9f7fdbf6752bd36197336a17fc767d14c8aa93a64a0bc32"},{"type":"text","text":"你好！看来你是用中文的。😊\n\n我是你的新助手，刚上线还没设定身份。你叫什么名字？想给我起个什么名字吗？"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":43,"output":76,"cacheRead":10468,"cacheWrite":772,"totalTokens":11359,"cost":{"input":0.0000129,"output":0.0000912,"cacheRead":0.0006280799999999999,"cacheWrite":0.0002895,"total":0.0010216799999999999}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774400718178,"responseId":"061267cf421d60392f830737b43e1adb"}}
